GT patch 0034: Window mode keeps the internal scale under a GPU budget (Rendering.GpuBudgetMs, default 10 ms,
0 = off): measured with the frame timestamps, one whole scale down while the GPU needs more per frame, one up
when the next scale would fit well inside and the last change is 6 s old (budget_scale_cap).

